  name "the-object-of-a-call-of-a-value-handing-on"
  note "`g` is held at `Procedure(Int(0...5)) -> Any`, and its closure takes any whole number. The argument is read as `Int`, which the build cannot prove inside the range, so the call stands judged: the judgement carries no answer type and nothing handed back, and position 0 with the range the run holds the argument to before the closure takes it."
